<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Swissair.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Swissair.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Swissair registered shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,450.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	16.18 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.60 CHF		  GEARING	10.46 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.MAY.98		 PAYDATE	30.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 50</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,360.00 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
